From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Aditya Singh <v-aditysing@microsoft.com>
Date: Fri, 18 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Adapt keda to the uplifted dependency APIs

- predicate.And became generic in controller-runtime v0.19 and cannot infer its
  type parameter from an empty argument list.
- custom-metrics-apiserver v1.31 AdapterBase.Run takes a context.Context.
- prometheus/common config round trippers now take SecretReader values.
- Group vault secrets by PkiData value: the key held a pointer to the range
  variable, which aliased every element under Go 1.21 loop semantics and becomes
  a distinct key per element once the go directive reaches 1.22+, causing one
  Vault PKI issuance per reference instead of one per group.
- Replace non-constant format strings, which go vet rejects once the go
  directive reaches 1.24.
---
diff --git a/cmd/adapter/main.go b/cmd/adapter/main.go
index a5b47c2..6dcacee 100644
--- a/cmd/adapter/main.go
+++ b/cmd/adapter/main.go
@@ -293,7 +293,7 @@ func main() {
 
 	RunMetricsServer(ctx, stopCh)
 
-	if err = cmd.Run(stopCh); err != nil {
+	if err = cmd.Run(ctx); err != nil {
 		return
 	}
 }
